                                       INPUT FILE
================================================================================
NAME = job.inp
|  1> ! UKS CAM-B3LYP def2-TZVPD def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF
|  2> %maxcore 3000
|  3> %scf
|  4>   MaxIter 300
|  5>   Guess HCore
|  6> end
|  7> %elprop
|  8>   Dipole false
|  9> end
| 10> %method
| 11>   IntAcc 40.0
| 12> end
| 13> %pointcharges "pc.pc"
| 14> * xyz -1 2
| 15> H: 0.010000 0.000000 0.000000
| 16>   AddGTO
| 17>     S 1
| 18>     1 0.035000 1.0
| 19>     S 1
| 20>     1 0.012000 1.0
| 21>     P 1
| 22>     1 0.035000 1.0
| 23>     P 1
| 24>     1 0.012000 1.0
| 25>   end
| 26>   NewAuxJGTO
| 27>     "AutoAux"
| 28>   end
| 29> *
| 30> 
| 31>                          ****END OF INPUT****
